  "description": "Gyul managed to grab a house that had cheap rent, but she couldn't enter the second floor. As it turns out, a homebody and a Yuutuber named Jinu were living on the second floor. With an introverted yet handsome internet star as her housemate, can Gyul's heart take it?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nKToon, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1962118347), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059899), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10259079), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/10066), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/gudok_plz), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62583743)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://play.hypercomic.io/Webtoon/episode/77/), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/125884), [French](https://www.ono.live/webtoon/mon-voisin-est-une-star)",
